            虎举 – Hǔ jǔ – (El Tigre Levanta)
          </h3>
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="chev fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></span>
        </summary>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-start">
